#\\\|HO4UD4NA7TJHXCS5LP6AEEX7UXKX746RF2NCH6AOSCDMHPA3YI7 \ / AMOS7 \ YOURUM ::
#\[7]W2GP5FUTWDSUSGNS7NRVYMZAKCZ5IYRIWDD2HONQVQLQ4OYXKKBA 7  DATA SIGNATURE ::
#:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::
